{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter this 3D action-adventure world that will test your daring, strategy and reflexes! In this fast-paced journey, you take on the role of a fearless chicken on a mission to protect his faithful companion, Chick, from the persistent bees who are chasing him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/correria_alfa.gif?t=1745074134\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge the clock!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only 180 seconds per level, every second counts. Can you collect all the keys and reach the door before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Protect Chick!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feathered friend is counting on you. Defend him from the bee attacks and keep his precious life intact. Every collision is a test of your skill \u2013 are you ready to be the hero he needs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive visuals and sound!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although in 3D, the game features 2D explosion effects to give the player a fun cartoon feel every time a bee is blown up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/porta.gif?t=1745074134\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join the adventure now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Download <i>Chick Defender</i> and embark on a journey where every key is a step towards victory, every bee is a challenge to overcome and every level is a test of your bravery. Do you have what it takes to save Chick and show that you can reach higher and higher levels? Prove it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655200?t=1745074134","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/13ca9b5f0a27d582993f8e2f1e1633ccc61acdb5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745074134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/736cf8d270a8bd7058a9a24555b8d9878920ed1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745074134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/736cf8d270a8bd7058a9a24555b8d9878920ed1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745074134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter this 3D action-adventure world that will test your daring, strategy and reflexes! In this fast-paced journey, you take on the role of a fearless chicken on a mission to protect his faithful companion, Chick, from the persistent bees who are chasing him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/correria_alfa.gif?t=1745074134\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge the clock!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only 180 seconds per level, every second counts. Can you collect all the keys and reach the door before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Protect Chick!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feathered friend is counting on you. Defend him from the bee attacks and keep his precious life intact. Every collision is a test of your skill \u2013 are you ready to be the hero he needs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive visuals and sound!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although in 3D, the game features 2D explosion effects to give the player a fun cartoon feel every time a bee is blown up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/porta.gif?t=1745074134\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join the adventure now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Download <i>Chick Defender</i> and embark on a journey where every key is a step towards victory, every bee is a challenge to overcome and every level is a test of your bravery. Do you have what it takes to save Chick and show that you can reach higher and higher levels? Prove it!</p>","developers":["Igarashi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/bd21d6133f7e30155d215b3a0aa1d0f0af95aaa3/header.jpg?t=1745074134","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124977,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124977/movie480.mp4?t=1744738963","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124977/movie_max.mp4?t=1744738963"},"name":"Chick Defender","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124977/94bde3819e09a03f517c3ddc57704441f3c73a39/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744738963","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124977/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744738963","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124977/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744738963"}}],"name":"Chick Defender","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB av